@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Knowledge boundary
+
+`Knowledge::Catalog.list(tenant_id:)` is the public read boundary for published
+Documents. Delivery code uses this API and does not query Knowledge persistence
+or reference `Knowledge::Document`.
+
+## Rollback
+
+If this boundary must be rolled back before a future persistence migration, revert
+the delivery change to its prior response mapping while retaining the existing
+`documents` table and `Knowledge::Document` model. The Catalog implementation can
+continue to delegate to that model until a separately reviewed persistence change
+is ready; no table or record conversion is part of this extraction.
